{"schemaVersion":1,"objectId":"stock301156","records":[{"id":"1802174155","objectId":"stock301156","title":"因为转赠了。。现在的价格相当于15-6块钱。。还是太贵了","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,301156,1802174155.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 23:06:02","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":44,"commentCount":2,"content":"","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":2,"body":"missing","reportedComments":2,"commentSource":"public-web-and-child-pagination","bodySource":"html-body","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"301156","comments":[{"id":"9984283583","text":"你们是竞调过公司，了解它的实际市值吗？再说，股价什么时候与公司实际情况挂钩了？难道不是借大盘指数连续下跌顾一做空股价造成股价超跌？这是典型的马后炮理论，看到股价跌成这样，就依据公司基本面来给市值下结论。举个例子，宇树科技就值3000亿元市值？还有哪个科技公司的股价不高？以现在的特色股市行情来看，市值与公司基本面、预期价值毫无关联。资金在哪，哪就是公司市值所在，资金不在哪，公司市值就不停下跌。我们只能坐等资金进来。","at":"2026-11-27 10:24:11","replyTo":null},{"id":"9984254428","text":"就这点市值了","at":"2026-11-27 09:54:42","replyTo":null}]},{"id":"1801574462","objectId":"stock301156","title":"美农生物：融资净偿还24万元，融资余额3662.38万元","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,301156,1801574462.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 09:17:10","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":43,"commentCount":0,"content":"","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":0,"body":"missing","reportedComments":0,"commentSource":"embedded-page","bodySource":"html-body","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"301156","comments":[]}]}
